      <strong>The right skill portfolio unlocks stronger high income opportunities, and that combination
      is what actually moves you toward earlier financial freedom</strong> — not the single loudest salary
      number attached to any one course name. Keep that chain in mind through every comparison in this
      article.
    </p>
  </div>

